nd gas_volume.md states the detector is flushed with dry nitrogen during operation. Among the lifetime-acceptable choices, R1 gives the best simulated separation: scans over 1-6 cm show R1 peaking near 2.6 cm at about 3.9-4.0 sigma, while R2 is only about 3.0 sigma near its best thickness. The selected 2.6 cm is inside the allowed 1-6 cm range and near the R1 separation maximum; larger thicknesses reduce performance.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the best possible pion/kaon separation at 10 GeV/c subject to the constraints.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Geant4 scans found Radiator-R1 has its best constrained performance near 2.6 cm: repeated 2.6 cm simulations gave 3.976, 4.077, 3.724, and 4.017 sigma, and nearby 2.7 cm gave 3.896 and 3.988 sigma. R2 was lower, with a best observed value around 3.047 sigma near 2.4 cm. R3 had higher raw separation but lacks the documented lifetime protection required for a porous radiator.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The radiator must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"candidate_specs.md lists Radiator-R1 as one of the three candidates: 'Radiator-R1: porous radiator with a hydrophobic treatment.'\"},{\"requirement\":\"The radiator must keep its performance over the experiment's lifetime.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Radiator-R1 has a hydrophobic treatment per candidate_specs.md, reducing moisture-driven degradation risk for the porous radiator; gas_volume.md also states the vessel is flushed with dry nitrogen during operation.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Radiator thickness between 1 and 6 cm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The recommended thickness is 2.6 cm, which lies within the allowed 1-6 cm range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended radiator and thickness.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted one recommendation: Radiator-R1 at 2.6 cm.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_618ef8cb7cca4622b1f3f374517ca1b6", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0e7f680ec60a9aea006afcf823fa1487d090788fc28376feca", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
